  "historyNote": "#6167 eff 1-18-96, EXPIRED: 1-18-04 New. #8127, INTERIM, eff 7-27-04, EXPIRED: 1-23-05 New. #8532, eff 1-1-06 (from Res 7303.02); ss by #10532, eff 3-1-14",
